WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:48.860
Okay, everyone!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:49.970
Listen up!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:55.370
Today, the fifth grade Star and Moon classes will be having a sketching contest.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:01.850
Use this opportunity to a take a fresh look at your familiar school, it may lead to new discoveries.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.140
This is going to be so much fun!

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.920
You've been looking forward to this for a very long time, Miki.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:01.850
Of course!

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:02.930
But...

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.670
Amu-chan doesn't look very excited.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:08.440
Not true.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.250
I'm totally pumped. {haha, yeah, you sound pumped}

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.040
It's because she's bad at stuff like drawing.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:14.770
Hinamori-san.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:15.270
Huh?

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:16.250
Here.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.910
Let's draw together.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.390
From Nadeshiko.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.820
Okay.

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:33.120
Were you paying attention to what the teacher was saying, Himamori-san?

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.220
The motif for your sketch today should be "your favorite place at school."

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.960
Nikaidou-sensei.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:45.720
Sketch of the Heart!

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:45.720
Episode 24

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.480
Honestly, I can't believe you have the nerve to be a teacher again.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.680
Didn't you quit?

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.190
I was formally hired as a teacher this time.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.740
I've had a teacher's license all along.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.050
You have no shame.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.390
Sensei!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:03.140
You've become a real teacher, then?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.020
Come back, Su!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.110
Can't I keep just this one?

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.620
Not a chance!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.080
Well then, bye!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.930
Good luck with your assignment!

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:15.440
He was our enemy just the other day.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.090
What's with the change of character?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.650
It should be fine.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.410
He's no longer associated with Easter.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.120
Anyway, where do you wanna draw, Amu-chan?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.790
My favorite place, huh?

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:28.920
It's gotta be...

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.310
There, of course.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.540
The Royal Garden!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:41.060
Maybe it is now, but Amu-chan was a wreck the first time she came here.

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:43.130
Is that true?

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:44.430
Oh, right.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:47.950
That was before Su was born.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:51.960
You're Hinamori Amu-san, correct?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.140
Yes...

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:56.970
We'll be waiting for you in the Royal Garden after school today.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.260
The Royal Garden?

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.130
Excuse me.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:06.680
Wow.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.850
Hello, Hinamori-san.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.550
Welcome to the Royal Garden.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:20.760
We Guardians are all Character Bearers,

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.620
and we've inherited these positions generation after generation.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.210
That's why, Hinamori Amu-san,

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.640
we would like you to join the Guardians.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.080
Um...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.280
Um?

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:32.500
No!

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.930
I'm sorry!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.820
She has not changed very much.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:39.630
Yep, yep.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.390
Be quiet!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.600
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.930
Th-The Demon Lord's castle.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.010
Want to Character Change with me?

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.460
Nah, no thanks.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.140
Man, I really suck at drawing.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.010
Besides, even though this is my favorite place and all,

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.750
something's just not right.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:07.120
Amu-chan, why don't we check out a few other places for a change of scenery?

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:09.260
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:12.400
I would love to try drawing other places!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.430
All right, let's do it.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.810
Tadase-kun.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.480
What is it?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.380
Nothing.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:30.090
I was just thinking about how much has happened in the past few months.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:53.220
It feels like it was ages ago when I first became Amulet Heart and jumped through this sky.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.220
Found them.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.600
What are you doing to my eggs?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.470
Amu-chan!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.870
Believe! Believe in who you want to be!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.360
What's up with this outfit?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:32.720
This is so embarrassing!

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.390
I'm not like this at all!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.550
But this is strange,

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:42.180
my body's light as a feather!

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.030
Hey, Amu-chan!

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.710
Can we draw the view from here?

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:53.490
Uh-huh.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.100
Yay!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.520
I'll teach you the trick to drawing wide spaces.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.770
Thank you, Sensei!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.100
When I first moved to this town,

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.260
I didn't have any friends.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.810
But...

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:14.550
Please give me courage

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.520
to be reborn as the person I truly want to be.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:25.680
Right, so I made a wish, but...

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.680
Why are there eggs?!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.200
And starting that day,

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.770
my life became very eventful.

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.680
What are you doing, Ami-chan?

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.510
Let's jump!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.660
J-Jump?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.470
Hop!

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.470
Step!

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:48.380
Jump!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.950
Believe in me! Then you can be who you want-to-be!

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.410
Now I have Ran, always so cheerful and full of energy.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.270
All right, let's do it!

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:57.600
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.300
Incredible.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.600
Miki, cool-headed with great artistic sense.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.810
Leave this to Su!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:12.120
Chip!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.640
Syrup!

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.720
Whip!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.480
And Su, laid-back and girlish.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.580
And then I met the Guardians.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:34.950
"Someday, someone special with three Guardian Eggs will appear.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:35.950
Keep this until that time comes."

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:41.430
The Founding King left this Humpty Lock with those words.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:45.800
Hinamori-san. {Not 100% copied, but he's not saying it exactly the same.}

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.930
This lock belongs to you.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.520
Tadase-kun.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.540
The prince of my dreams.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.680
But when I confessed my feelings after Character Changing with Ran,

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.470
I was totally shot down.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:04.560
To top it all off,

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.430
Tadase-kun admitted that the person he likes is a post-Character Transformed me.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:14.020
But still, like Ran says, I'll have plenty of other chances.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:18.270
Uh, the fact that his dream is to conquer the world is pretty out there, though.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:27.950
Nadeshiko is a much more refined girl than I am.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.430
She's elegant, and graceful, and good at cooking.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.860
And she even knows Japanese dance.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.550
Seriously, she's perfect.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.640
I'm a girl and I still admire her.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:42.020
Uh, Nadeshiko after Character Changing is a different story, though.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.310
Amu-chan!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.430
The oldest Guardian would be Kukai.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.850
I don't feel the need to act super polite just because he's older.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.390
He's good at all kinds of sports, and Captain of the soccer team.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.640
What's up with this girl? She's hilarious!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:01.810
He feels sort of like a reliable older brother with a great sense of humor, I guess.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.020
Then let's go get some ice cream.

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.860
Yaya constantly overeats and overindulges.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:09.640
She's always got candy on the brain.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.060
It's not an issue since she works really hard at ballet,

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.700
but she better not come crying to me when she puts on weight.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.540
Oh yeah,

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.720
I think she made me buy her ice cream after that.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.560
It feels like we're always together.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:26.390
I'm so glad I joined the Guardians.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.870
,I'm going to engrave this feeling in my heart.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.100
Someday, let's kick Nikaidou's butt together!

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.470
Yeah!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.020
We should get going.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.850
Did you decide where you want to draw?

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.650
No, not yet.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:52.380
There's nothing wrong with taking our time.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.520
That's true.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.610
We've still got plenty of time!

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.100
It's really quiet.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:16.700
Yeah.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.100
Everyone's in class.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:23.560
This reminds me of our grand adventure with Ami-chan.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.940
"Within the egg of dreams a fearsome dragon lies sleeping..."

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.810
Egg of dreams?

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:36.850
It's the Embryo!

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:38.670
All right!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:39.700
Let us begin our search!

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.030
Yeah!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.100
Yeah.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.200
Let's go.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.830
Found you!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.060
We've finally found it.

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:07.570
Ami!

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.720
You can't just take off like that!

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.830
I sorry.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.820
We ended up not finding the Embryo.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.070
Well, of course not.

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.230
Like it's going to be that easy.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.850
I'm finished, Sensei!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:28.540
You were in my way, too.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:31.340
Today's assignment was to write a proverb.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:32.740
What on earth is this?

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:35.930
These words have impacted me more than any others in my entire life!

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:38.100
They surpass any proverb!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.370
I intend to create an anthology of Hinamori-senpai's wonderful sayings!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:46.350
She was amazingly, incredibly wonderful that day!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.990
There's a game we want...

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.640
Um... Um...

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.640
Hey.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:53.970
You're in my way.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:59.220
You're Seiyo Elementary's ultimate "cool & spicy" student,

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.890
Hinamori Amu-san!

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.120
W-We're sorry!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.560
Thank you so much!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.430
Could I please have your autograph?

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:10.740
Are you stupid?

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.970
You were in my way, too.

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.080
Be more careful.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.310
She's so cool!

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:26.440
You were the epitome of cool, Hinamori-senpai!

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.620
What did you say? You want more?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.600
Yes, yes. I understand completely.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.610
Well then, I'll carry on!

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:34.140
Let's Hinamori!

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:40.260
I wonder if there really can be a good or bad egg in one's heart.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.850
No matter how far you go, you'll always be connected under the same sky.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.380
Your friends will always be your friends, no matter where you are.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.770
Isn't it okay to change?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:48.880
Well, something like that.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:51.130
I was afraid to change, too, you know.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.140
Let's get along together,

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.430
from one scaredy-cat to another.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.310
Sugar, honey, syrup.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:05.060
Let irritation and gloom melt into something sweet!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:10.220
Impossible!

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:12.750
What's impossible?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.060
You have to believe in yourself,

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.540
or else your dream will vanish before your eyes!

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:20.560
It's way too soon for you to do nothing but give up!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.640
Stop being a crybaby!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.190
Who cares if you messed up a bit?

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:30.330
Don't go calling all the time your mom spent useless!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.470
You were really cool when you were dancing.

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:37.330
Even when Yaya fell, she didn't cry about it, she just go back up!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.220
Both of you are awesome primas!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.220
No one'll ever like someone as hyper as me!

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.750
No one'll ever like me!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.600
Hate!{please check the timing on this line. Is it supposed to be at the later scream, or do I need to incorporate all of the earlier scream as well?}

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:51.350
After dragging me around all day, don't start doubting what makes you who you are!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.070
Heart Rod!

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.850
Spiral Heart!

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:01.410
Black Magic!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.280
Magic!

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:03.130
Magic!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.560
Now it's my turn!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.020
Colorful Canvas!

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:16.870
Others don't get to decide whether or not you have talent!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.640
Don't X yourself out like that!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.930
Negative Heart:

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.850
Lock On!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.120
Open Heart!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.680
"Cool & spicy!"

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:48.330
Cool & Spicy

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.430
This shall be the cover for the anthology of Hinamori-senpai's wonderful sayings!

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:55.120
Cool & Spicy

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.600
I see.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.100
Great, go you.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:55.890
Thanks!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:59.790
5th Grade Star Class

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.350
Why is it

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.570
that the sky's the same,

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.700
and yet it feels different from before I met everyone?

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:12.420
Hey.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.170
Will you guys show me what you were drawing earlier?

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.600
Sure!

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:18.870
What do you think?

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.480
That's wonderful, Miki.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.090
Your drawing is beautiful.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.640
How should I describe it?

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.150
It's bold and idiosyncratic.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.390
Yay!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:28.760
What's that?

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:32.350
Clouds as puffy as Choux à la Crème.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.930
Everyone's pictures turned out so different.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.360
Yoru!

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:40.020
And...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:40.790
It's Il!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:41.600
Don't you forget it!

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:43.800
Why are you here?

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.300
Are you on a date?

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.600
So jealous.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.170
Not a chance.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.800
I was bored at Utau's photo shoot,

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:54.390
so I'm keeping Yoru company on his walk.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.930
It's not like I asked you to come along-nya!

00:16:56.930 --> 00:17:01.950
But your ears and tail were all droopy because Ikuto wasn't paying any attention to you.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.100
Nuh-uh, they weren't-nya!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.970
What're you freaking out for?

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.700
I'm not-nya!

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:08.600
Too much free time.

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:10.270
Don't compare yourselves to us!

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.340
Besides, what's so great about drawing?

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.900
It's fun.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:15.920
Yep!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.190
Then show me-nya!

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:19.060
Give it back!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.390
No way!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.410
Jeez!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:24.540
This is so typical whenever Yoru's around.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.520
Over here!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.480
He pops out of nowhere,

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.060
just like an alley cat.

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.990
Why did <i>he</i> just come to mind?

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:37.220
I can never figure out what that guy's thinking.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.600
So your name is Amu?

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.130
Don't touch me there, you jerk!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.410
We're giving this to you

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.970
as repayment.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.680
I tricked you.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.140
If you continue to stay with that little king of yours,

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:09.180
we'll be enemies.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.510
Tell me!

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.020
Were you the one who turned them into X Eggs?

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.020
Did you?!

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:36.720
Even though he's with Easter,

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:40.210
there are times when I think he's a good guy.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:41.560
And...

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.520
I wish I knew how he and Hoshina Utau are connected.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.660
Character Transformation: Lunatic Charm!

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:09.970
I won't lose...

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.600
I won't lose to someone like you!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.350
I won't lose either!

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:22.600
Sorry, but I won't give up a millimeter to someone who puts X's on other peoples' eggs!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:25.190
If you don't finish what you set out to do,

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.660
your Character will have been wasted!

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:31.140
Yikes, what a crappy drawing.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.350
You really suck-nya.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:34.940
That's not true!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.430
I'm at least better than Amu-chan!

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.600
I think you just said something unintentionally mean.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.090
Th-The mood just got really tense-nya.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:44.900
L-Let's go.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.720
Amu-chan, sorry about that.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.360
It's fine. It's fine.

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:53.310
I totally don't mind.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.150
Huh?

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.190
Himamori-san.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:57.140
What are you doing here?

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.380
You shouldn't skip class.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.060
I'm not skipping!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.270
Sensei, what's that you're carrying?

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.180
A robot!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.450
The Craft Club's going to use it.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:09.800
Craft Club?

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.580
We have one of those?

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.720
I just started it.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.750
How very delightful!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.850
Would you like to join?

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.020
May I?

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:20.370
Of course!

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:25.060
My Guardian Character died before it was even born.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:29.020
Remake Honey!

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:33.140
I'm glad we can finally meet!

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.980
Good-bye.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:35.720
See you again.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:47.480
Keep reinventing and polishing yourself, and who you want to be

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:50.660
can be reborn over and over.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:53.640
Can I really?

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:59.470
I'm sure your new egg will be one belonging to a wonderful teacher.

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.720
Yeah.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:12.600
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.850
Did you decide where you want to draw?

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:16.640
Yep!

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:24.960
Oh, Amu-chan.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.310
Did you finish your drawing?

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:27.350
I'm about to!

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:42.730
My favorite place.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:59.020
It's a pretty pathetic drawing,

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:00.680
but I suppose it's not all bad.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:10.100
My very favorite place

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:13.650
is right here!

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:55.310
Amu-chan, remember our visit to Nadeshiko's place a while back?

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:55.930
Of course!

00:23:56.190 --> 00:23:58.090
Her dancing sure was beautiful.

00:23:58.090 --> 00:23:59.360
Thank you, Amu-chan.

00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:01.700
I'd like to go to your house again sometime.

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:02.960
You know, Amu-chan...

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.370
There's something I haven't told you.

00:24:05.370 --> 00:24:06.770
What are you acting all serious?

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:07.690
Something tells me...

00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:10.090
Something thrilling will happen.

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:11.340
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.380
Nadeshiko! A Farewell in Spring!?

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:16.440
You'll finally learn Nadeshiko's secret.

00:24:16.440 --> 00:24:17.390
Who are you?

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:20.040
And what do you mean by farewell!?
